            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Hokkaido Sachi - Thảo Điền",
            "review_text": "Rei\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGood food, and convenient place to visit by using metro.\nJan 2025 • Solo\nI always eat at Hokkaido Sachi with my family and friends so I'm a relugar at this place since 2019. \nThe sashimi and eggs are good to eat (I ordered a lot of eggs) \nHitsumabushi (Rice with a large portion of eel) is what I recommend.\nPlus, It's also near at the metro station (An Phu platform) so it's pretty convenient.\nRead more\nWritten January 24, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
